OL,3,GNEWSAAir ambulance gusts left woman
OL,4,Aseriously injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FA person filming an air ambulance
OL,7,Ftaking off was seriously injured after
OL,8,Fthe gusts knocked her over, a report
OL,9,Fhas revealed.
OL,11,FThe woman was blown off her feet while
OL,12,Fvideoing the helicopter outside her
OL,13,Fhouse in Southend-on-Sea in Essex on 28
OL,14,FFebruary.
OL,16,FShe was 30m (98ft) away and a hedgerow
OL,17,Fhad blocked the pilot's view of her,
OL,18,Fthe Air Accidents Investigation Branch
OL,19,F(AAIB) found.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
