OL,3,GNEWSAAir ambulance gusts left woman
OL,4,Aseriously injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FEssex & Herts Air Ambulance, which
OL,7,Foperated the aircraft, issued pilots
OL,8,Fwith a reminder of the hazards
OL,9,Fassociated with "downwash" after the
OL,10,Fincident.
